  "description": "Gyeongwoo lives and dies by his viewer count. He’d jump through fiery hoops if it meant going viral, even if it meant going live with his personal nemesis, Do Jiho—the reigning king of the platform and the one person Gyeongwoo wants to punch in the face. Forced into a room with his arch-rival for a live-streamed penalty game, Gyeongwoo promises his fans he'll do whatever they ask. But as the live chat's requests grow increasingly shameless, Gyeongwoo realizes too late that Jiho isn't just playing along for the views—he's using the broadcast to finally make Gyeongwoo his own.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Peanutoon's Gosuwi BL Danpyeonseon (고수위 BL 단편선) Collection.*",
